WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.510
Fred Barker and his mother, Ma Parker, died in&nbsp;
their Florida bungalow their bodies riddled with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:14.610
machine-gun bullets. The year 1935 found the G-Men&nbsp;
working at top speed many kidnappers were rounded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:19.770
up. Among whom was Bruno Richard Hauptmann who&nbsp;
died in the electric chair for the kidnapping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:26.160
of the Lindbergh baby. Alvin Karpis who more than&nbsp;
two years ago shot his way out of an Atlantic City&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:33.240
hotel was captured in an apartment in New Orleans&nbsp;
on May 1st, 1936 by J Edgar Hoover and his G-Men.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:39.000
Quickly following his capture Harry Campbell&nbsp;
one of Karpis' henchmen was captured in Toledo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.120
Ohio. Before the papers could get onto the street&nbsp;
with this announcement, G-Men reported the capture&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:51.630
of William Mahan wanted in the Weyerhaeuser&nbsp;
kidnapping. Climaxing a sensational ten-day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:57.720
roundup of the nation's public enemies on May&nbsp;
11th, 1936 the federal agents captured the last&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:03.630
of the public enemies Thomas H. Robinson for the&nbsp;
kidnapping of Mrs. Alice Stoll. The alertness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:09.990
of this obscure clerk, Lynn Allen, led to&nbsp;
Robinson's capture - who walked in as a woman to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:15.270
the drugstore where Allen was employed and whose&nbsp;
suspicions were so aroused by Robinson's actions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:20.820
that he notified the Pasadena Authority. The G-Men&nbsp;
were called in and he was soon traced to this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:27.600
modest little home in Glendale, California where&nbsp;
he was taken without a struggle. The gangsters are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:33.240
vanishing from our nation. Crime can and will be&nbsp;
put down in America. The Department of Justice is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:37.950
leading the way and deserves of both of thanks&nbsp;
from every right-thinking person in America.

